export anchor DarkDuotoneStyle:
    number: 253
    screen: DesignEditor
    name: Dark duotone
    idea: Everything is drawn in exactly two tones, deep indigo and electric orange, with hierarchy made by inverting blocks, halftone dots and circles instead of extra colours.
    base: dark
    palette:
        indigo: #1b1350, the page, panels and text on orange
        orange: #ff7a1f, all other text, lines, inverted bands, the active tool, the selected row, the frame preview and focus
    type:
        One geometric stack, Futura, Century Gothic, Avenir Next, Segoe UI,
        system-ui, Arial. Body 14px at 1.45 in 600 for weight on orange.
        The file name 26px 700, inspector values 22px 700 inside circles,
        panel heads 13px 700 caps tracked 0.1em, and the sheet title 36px.
    layout:
        An orange header band with indigo text holds an indigo B disc, Home
        v3 over Website redesign and Brightwork Canvas, three initials discs
        alternating filled and outlined, an outlined Present and an indigo
        Share. Below, a 72px tool rail with six 48px ringed circles, Move
        filled orange, and ZOOM 66% set vertically at its foot. The canvas
        has orange halftone dots fading from the top left and shows the
        Hero frame previewed in two tones, an orange frame with indigo
        headline, an indigo pill button and an indigo halftone screenshot
        area, inside a dashed orange selection with ringed round handles
        and an indigo comment bubble. A 300px side column stacks the layers
        and the inspector, each under an inverted orange head. Layer rows
        are pills, Hero filled orange with Selected. The inspector shows X,
        Y, W and H as four ringed circles, then ruled rows for Fill, Auto
        layout, Gap and Padding, Corner radius and Export. An orange status
        band closes the screen. Below 760px the rail and side column hide
        and the six ringed tools sit in a row under the canvas.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16 to 20px panel padding, 28 to 32px around the canvas.
    density: Medium. Tool rail, canvas and one side column with layers over the inspector.
    corners: Round. Pills and circles for tools, rows, buttons and value dials, 24px cards.
    borders: 2px orange lines between rail, canvas and side column and on rows, a dashed 2px orange selection.
    shadows: None. Emphasis is an inverted orange block.
    icons:
        20px round line icons at 2px stroke inside 48px circles. Saved uses a
        check circle, editing two people and the version a tag, each with
        words on the orange band.
    focus: A 3px orange outline offset 3px with a 6px indigo gap and a 2px orange outer ring.
    tone: Calm and graphic, such as Shown in duotone and Inspector.
